  "details": "Currently, your view will drift away from your avatar significantly when siting in a station that moves unless you entered it while it was facing a specific direction (positive X I think). The chairs in the mirror room seem to be set up fine, but the ones on the rings are not.\nThis issue has existed in VRChat for a long time. Since chairs were never originally intended to rotate, I wasn't sure if it was considered a bug. Now that the Hub features movable chairs though, I believe it needs to be taken care of in one way or another.",
